        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "M. All bricklayers while working on carbon shall be allowed twenty minutes cleanup time. This shall be at noon and quitting time, each day. All carbon brick work shall be paid at twenty-five cents (25¢) per hour above the rate set forth in this Agreement.",
